1
00:02:04,373 --> 00:02:08,863
No living creature was hurt during
the production of this show.

2
00:02:10,325 --> 00:02:28,735
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

3
00:02:33,667 --> 00:02:35,227
They are coming, Togay.

4
00:02:54,410 --> 00:02:56,060
Where is Algu?

5
00:04:01,230 --> 00:04:03,660
The truth is like a sharp dagger.

6
00:04:03,977 --> 00:04:08,257
The dagger has one trace while a
word has a thousand traces.

7
00:04:09,893 --> 00:04:13,483
Forgive me, Togay.

8
00:04:39,327 --> 00:04:42,607
Is the enemy smarter than you?

9
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,200
Huh?

10
00:04:47,073 --> 00:04:48,903
Tell me.

11
00:04:50,188 --> 00:04:52,138
Tell me.

12
00:04:57,785 --> 00:05:00,225
I can't trust you...

13
00:05:01,018 --> 00:05:03,078
if I believe in this.

14
00:05:06,219 --> 00:05:08,099
The Alps searched him.

15
00:05:08,860 --> 00:05:11,590
We thought he can't hide anything.

16
00:05:12,367 --> 00:05:16,007
He might have hidden it somewhere
that even the devil can't think of.

17
00:05:18,494 --> 00:05:20,324
Neither Mongols nor Rums...

18
00:05:20,807 --> 00:05:25,347
can't bring anything to my tent.

19
00:05:26,244 --> 00:05:29,634
- Do you understand?
- Yes, my Bey.

20
00:05:38,001 --> 00:05:40,121
My Alps.

21
00:05:41,829 --> 00:05:45,859
You are smarter, braver...

22
00:05:47,034 --> 00:05:50,544
and believer...

23
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:54,350
than Mongol and Rum soldiers.

24
00:05:59,879 --> 00:06:02,839
- Don't betray my trust.
- Yes, my Bey.

25
00:06:03,094 --> 00:06:04,584
Yes, my Bey.

26
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:08,670
- Do you understand?
- Yes, my Bey.

27
00:06:23,230 --> 00:06:25,200
If we gave him the golds...

28
00:06:26,161 --> 00:06:28,691
he wouldn't commit the killing.

29
00:06:29,364 --> 00:06:33,154
He thought of that.

30
00:06:37,430 --> 00:06:41,430
He will attack us after what happened.

31
00:06:42,379 --> 00:06:46,169
Our enemies will grow stronger too
when we grow stronger.

32
00:06:46,786 --> 00:06:48,736
After the victories we gain...

33
00:06:49,018 --> 00:06:53,458
these lands will be
attacked by more Mongols and Rums.

34
00:06:54,898 --> 00:06:58,728
We won't ever stop.

35
00:07:00,923 --> 00:07:03,313
Never.

36
00:07:50,790 --> 00:07:54,790
Genghis Khan, by Tengri's (God) power...

37
00:07:55,765 --> 00:08:01,275
if I don't keep my promise, may the
curse of dark spirits be upon me!

38
00:08:01,780 --> 00:08:04,350
You will die Osman!

39
00:08:04,742 --> 00:08:06,592
You will die!

40
00:09:08,282 --> 00:09:10,622
What is your command, Osman Bey?

41
00:09:11,935 --> 00:09:17,365
Take measures around
the tent and in Söğüt, brother.

42
00:09:18,533 --> 00:09:22,323
Send news to Umur Bey and Turkmen Beys.

43
00:09:22,634 --> 00:09:25,384
They should take measures too.

44
00:09:26,815 --> 00:09:31,145
We don't know where
Togay will attack from.

45
00:09:33,594 --> 00:09:35,714
We should be careful.

46
00:09:35,978 --> 00:09:37,378
From now on...

47
00:09:38,744 --> 00:09:41,844
we are at a point of no return.

48
00:09:43,315 --> 00:09:48,845
Don't think that I forgave you just
because I didn't send you to Engürü.

49
00:09:49,739 --> 00:09:55,149
You included Osman Bey in this situation
by going to Kayı Tent without telling me.

50
00:09:56,119 --> 00:09:57,849
Tell me.

51
00:09:58,271 --> 00:10:02,121
Why did you do that?
Why did you see Osman Bey?

52
00:10:03,318 --> 00:10:05,618
What was your intention?

53
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:12,840
I can't recognize you anymore.

54
00:10:15,183 --> 00:10:18,973
Why did you change your
attitude towards Osman Bey?

55
00:10:23,550 --> 00:10:25,940
I thought I owe him.

56
00:10:28,275 --> 00:10:31,055
I didn't want
to leave without saying goodbye.

57
00:10:31,745 --> 00:10:33,355
Is that all?

58
00:10:34,016 --> 00:10:36,826
Is that all you will say?

59
00:10:40,265 --> 00:10:43,145
Isn't it enough?

60
00:10:51,370 --> 00:10:52,840
Don't...

61
00:10:55,041 --> 00:10:57,901
disrespect me.

62
00:10:58,542 --> 00:11:02,312
Don't disrespect your father's orders.

63
00:11:03,421 --> 00:11:09,631
You don't owe anything to
anyone as long as I am here.

64
00:11:23,105 --> 00:11:26,115
I don't think I owe you, father.

65
00:11:28,584 --> 00:11:30,864
As I can't pay away.

66
00:11:51,148 --> 00:11:53,628
We are Osman Bey's hawks.

67
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:59,980
We will cut the world
off if he commands us to!

68
00:12:00,063 --> 00:12:01,883
We will!

69
00:12:03,167 --> 00:12:06,427
We will always fight...

70
00:12:06,486 --> 00:12:08,826
until we become a state.

71
00:12:08,877 --> 00:12:10,127
We will!

72
00:12:10,889 --> 00:12:15,719
Osman Bey is my Bey, Bamsı Bey is
my father. You are my brothers.

73
00:12:15,942 --> 00:12:21,902
I will live for our claim until I die!

74
00:12:31,374 --> 00:12:32,734
I promise.

75
00:12:36,390 --> 00:12:38,160
I promise.

76
00:12:41,948 --> 00:12:45,668
I promise.

77
00:12:53,358 --> 00:12:55,448
I promise.

78
00:13:04,807 --> 00:13:06,647
Alps.

79
00:13:07,461 --> 00:13:09,451
Why do you swear?

80
00:13:09,547 --> 00:13:12,447
I am here too.

81
00:13:35,869 --> 00:13:39,129
Konya / Seljuqs Palace

82
00:13:56,399 --> 00:13:57,989
Osman.

83
00:14:10,042 --> 00:14:16,052
Osman beat my messenger
and threw him out.

84
00:14:17,675 --> 00:14:20,015
Now, I am asking you.

85
00:14:20,699 --> 00:14:23,049
Do you know what does it mean?

86
00:14:23,213 --> 00:14:25,143
I know.

87
00:14:25,394 --> 00:14:31,464
Osman is rebelling and Togay
will devastate Kayı Tent

88
00:14:33,955 --> 00:14:40,275
Do I need to remind you who made you
sit the throne you engaged?

89
00:14:42,448 --> 00:14:45,758
Osman Bey obviously made a huge mistake.

90
00:14:46,122 --> 00:14:51,082
While I am surrounded by enemies...

91
00:14:52,118 --> 00:14:55,298
I can't take another rebel.

92
00:14:55,759 --> 00:15:00,269
What I should do is to
punish Osman Bey myself.

93
00:15:01,143 --> 00:15:03,673
How will you do that, Sultan mesut?

94
00:15:03,808 --> 00:15:07,368
Will you send the Seljuqs army?

95
00:15:07,787 --> 00:15:13,247
An army for a Bey is a lot.
It is costly.

96
00:15:14,344 --> 00:15:18,804
I am sure you won't like
spending Geyhatu's charge.

97
00:15:19,368 --> 00:15:20,768
Then...

98
00:15:26,174 --> 00:15:29,014
I will summon Osman here.

99
00:15:29,112 --> 00:15:31,992
Don't you think he understands
your real intention?

100
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:35,700
No if I summon him in a good way.

101
00:15:36,696 --> 00:15:39,026
What are you thinking?

102
00:15:39,465 --> 00:15:43,775
I will invite Osman Bey
offering good gifts.

103
00:15:43,968 --> 00:15:45,758
Then?

104
00:15:46,220 --> 00:15:50,500
It's my job to punish him as a Sultan.

105
00:15:52,369 --> 00:15:55,499
Dinner is ready.

106
00:15:57,707 --> 00:16:00,277
You will be served with pheasant.

107
00:16:00,485 --> 00:16:07,585
Cooked with bay leaf and
zested with ripe plum, as you like.

108
00:16:09,755 --> 00:16:14,085
We may talk about what will happen
to Osman while we are walking.

109
00:16:37,123 --> 00:16:40,283
I have some news from my spy in Kayı Tent.

110
00:16:41,802 --> 00:16:43,842
Osman threw the messenger out of the tent.

111
00:16:43,888 --> 00:16:46,598
And Togay vented
his anger on the messenger.

112
00:16:48,646 --> 00:16:50,266
Osman.

113
00:16:50,614 --> 00:16:54,694
Am I surprised? No, not at all.

114
00:16:55,202 --> 00:16:58,992
Nikola, we had an agreement with Nikola.

115
00:16:59,250 --> 00:17:01,080
He said he would take it from Osman.

116
00:17:01,225 --> 00:17:04,605
- And I would give him gold.
- So?

117
00:17:04,695 --> 00:17:08,395
He would attack my
castle if I didn't give him gold.

118
00:17:10,535 --> 00:17:13,635
- I can't trust Togay anymore.
- However...

119
00:17:13,731 --> 00:17:16,381
You can trust me.

120
00:17:18,060 --> 00:17:20,450
Togay won't attack you.

121
00:17:20,608 --> 00:17:24,608
Because we will attack Togay.

122
00:17:25,239 --> 00:17:29,179
How? Togay is powerful.

123
00:17:29,604 --> 00:17:32,114
You know that, Nikola.

124
00:17:33,691 --> 00:17:37,421
Togay is only angry with Osman.

125
00:17:37,811 --> 00:17:41,811
They will fight each other.

126
00:17:41,890 --> 00:17:44,880
Then we will...

127
00:17:45,171 --> 00:17:48,121
watch them.

128
00:17:48,900 --> 00:17:52,900
Then we will attack...

129
00:17:54,329 --> 00:17:56,279
the survivor.

130
00:18:12,362 --> 00:18:13,702
May the spirits let...

131
00:18:13,793 --> 00:18:15,873
the dark vow...

132
00:18:16,559 --> 00:18:18,959
be broken.

133
00:18:42,530 --> 00:18:47,410
The soldiers are ready.
We are ready to fight, Togay.

134
00:18:48,701 --> 00:18:52,141
We are ready to fight, Togay.

135
00:18:53,372 --> 00:18:57,372
On behalf of the
dark forests, dark spirits...

136
00:18:58,874 --> 00:19:02,874
and the dark vows...

137
00:19:03,850 --> 00:19:06,920
May the breath of the death be with us...

138
00:19:07,374 --> 00:19:11,604
May my dark vow will be irrigated...

139
00:19:12,994 --> 00:19:16,064
with Osman's blood.

140
00:19:24,626 --> 00:19:29,166
Blood, blood, blood!

141
00:19:31,470 --> 00:19:32,850
He will die...

142
00:19:33,590 --> 00:19:36,160
tonight!

143
00:19:37,690 --> 00:19:41,690
Kayı Tent will be devastated!

144
00:19:43,731 --> 00:19:45,931
I want Osman alive.

145
00:19:46,911 --> 00:19:48,911
It is my...

146
00:19:49,798 --> 00:19:51,858
dark vow. (oath)

147
00:20:21,557 --> 00:20:24,397
Our attack will wait.

148
00:20:25,068 --> 00:20:29,068
Osman will wait for...

149
00:20:30,311 --> 00:20:33,151
virgins to be sacrificed to die.

150
00:20:36,131 --> 00:20:39,541
Why don't we devastate Kayı Tent?

151
00:20:41,187 --> 00:20:42,597
Geyhatu's man...

152
00:20:43,018 --> 00:20:45,608
made an agreement...

153
00:20:45,870 --> 00:20:48,150
with Sultan.

154
00:20:48,821 --> 00:20:51,921
Osman will be punished by him.

155
00:20:52,810 --> 00:20:57,450
You took a dark vow.

156
00:21:01,718 --> 00:21:07,898
My blood will silence the spirits' anger.

157
00:21:33,164 --> 00:21:34,524
Go now.

158
00:21:34,954 --> 00:21:39,744
Bring your soldiers and the Lords' golds.

159
00:21:40,474 --> 00:21:44,774
Burn all of the villages if necessary.

160
00:21:46,443 --> 00:21:50,163
What will happen to Yarhisar Lord?

161
00:21:50,237 --> 00:21:52,597
I will take care of him.

162
00:21:53,316 --> 00:21:55,186
You should go.

163
00:22:21,473 --> 00:22:25,793
- Salam Alaikum, my Sheikh.
- Alaikum Salam, Osman Bey.

164
00:22:25,812 --> 00:22:29,262
- May it be easy.
- Thank you.

165
00:22:32,723 --> 00:22:36,803
- It will be ready soon, Osman Bey.
- Keep working, my Sheikh.

166
00:22:37,438 --> 00:22:40,308
The dead water becomes blurred.

167
00:22:40,591 --> 00:22:44,271
The devil haunts the one who doesn't work.

168
00:22:44,451 --> 00:22:48,111
Effort makes the heart clean.

169
00:22:48,231 --> 00:22:52,051
The ones who work always remember Allah.

170
00:22:52,829 --> 00:22:55,539
Everything reminds them of...

171
00:22:56,997 --> 00:22:59,837
doomsday, Osman Bey.

172
00:23:02,015 --> 00:23:05,505
We need effort and work, Osman Bey.

173
00:23:06,183 --> 00:23:09,763
Being Ahi means effort and work.

174
00:23:13,323 --> 00:23:15,863
Your agreement with the Mongols is done.

175
00:23:16,481 --> 00:23:20,071
They tried to harm you
when they couldn't take the golds.

176
00:23:20,750 --> 00:23:24,070
Our Allah keeps our lives.

177
00:23:24,280 --> 00:23:28,060
No one can harm us
without Allah's permission.

178
00:23:28,479 --> 00:23:30,329
Yes, Osman Bey.

179
00:23:30,436 --> 00:23:35,316
The heathens need effort.

180
00:23:35,910 --> 00:23:40,010
Our effort for work
increases, our power increases.

181
00:23:40,361 --> 00:23:44,561
Our Alps are
waiting for their duties, my Sheikh

182
00:23:49,587 --> 00:23:53,377
- Salam Alaikum, my Sheikh.
- Alaikum Salam.

183
00:23:54,092 --> 00:23:55,572
My Bey.

184
00:24:15,293 --> 00:24:17,373
Aslan Bey, the emir of Sultan Mesut...

185
00:24:18,763 --> 00:24:21,363
is coming to our tent...

186
00:24:22,542 --> 00:24:25,272
from Konya.

187
00:24:27,508 --> 00:24:31,538
Everyone heard of the
messenger, obviously.

188
00:24:34,708 --> 00:24:35,808
Göktuğ...

189
00:24:36,573 --> 00:24:41,823
as Emir is coming here, prepare
some good food.

190
00:24:42,051 --> 00:24:44,561
Your command, my Bey.

191
00:24:50,209 --> 00:24:52,299
What do you think, my Sheikh?

192
00:24:53,325 --> 00:24:56,295
Why does Sultan send...

193
00:24:56,797 --> 00:24:58,747
his Emir?

194
00:24:58,883 --> 00:25:03,323
I wonder why. Is it because
of the messenger? (ambassador)

195
00:25:04,070 --> 00:25:06,290
Maybe, Osman Bey.

196
00:25:06,487 --> 00:25:10,487
However, Sultan Mesut is tied to the
Mongols.

197
00:25:10,539 --> 00:25:12,339
His hands are tied.

198
00:25:12,374 --> 00:25:14,144
Yes.

199
00:25:14,413 --> 00:25:18,633
That's why those
heathens, Mongols, come here and...

200
00:25:18,644 --> 00:25:21,664
ask for our golds.

201
00:25:23,479 --> 00:25:25,669
We have hope, Osman Bey.

202
00:25:25,827 --> 00:25:29,627
We have effort and hope.

203
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:33,700
You are right, my Sheikh.

204
00:25:34,122 --> 00:25:38,202
I will go to the tent if you excuse me.
I will talk to the Beys.

205
00:25:38,246 --> 00:25:41,916
Let's hear what Emir has to say.

206
00:25:42,412 --> 00:25:44,902
If you excuse me.

207
00:26:12,220 --> 00:26:17,550
Ertuğrul Ghazi's son Osman Bey!
The victory you've won against Rums...

208
00:26:17,550 --> 00:26:21,980
have impressed our sultan.

209
00:26:21,980 --> 00:26:26,442
He wanted to honor the ghazi
who made the victory possible.

210
00:26:26,781 --> 00:26:33,801
He presents you this robe of honor.

211
00:27:12,646 --> 00:27:16,646
My grandfather Süleyman Shah...

212
00:27:16,646 --> 00:27:20,646
and my father Ertuğrul Ghazi
were given lands here...

213
00:27:20,646 --> 00:27:26,686
by the Seljuks. They helped us
make here our home.

214
00:27:26,686 --> 00:27:30,686
We are grateful. We see its future
as ours...

215
00:27:31,723 --> 00:27:36,383
as do we see its cause
as ours.

216
00:27:38,234 --> 00:27:43,004
And we put our effort to
deserve...

217
00:27:43,004 --> 00:27:46,034
the robe of honor that our
sultan sent.

218
00:27:46,034 --> 00:27:51,154
Thank you, Osman Bey.
May your sword be sharp.

219
00:27:51,326 --> 00:27:53,376
Amin.
Amin.

220
00:27:53,376 --> 00:27:55,546
Amin.

221
00:28:11,641 --> 00:28:15,231
With the name of Allah.

222
00:28:26,324 --> 00:28:29,874
Enjoy your meal.

223
00:28:29,874 --> 00:28:35,014
Osman Bey, I see that the traditions
of our ancestors are alive with you.

224
00:28:36,279 --> 00:28:42,279
If we forget our traditions,
we'll lose our light.

225
00:28:42,719 --> 00:28:48,439
If we lose our light, we'll never
see forward.

226
00:28:49,309 --> 00:28:55,899
Inshallah, our sultan too will see
you with his own eyes.

227
00:28:57,648 --> 00:29:03,238
Osman Bey, our sultan is inviting you
to the Konya Palace.

228
00:29:14,855 --> 00:29:20,745
A blessing from our sultan.

229
00:29:21,464 --> 00:29:26,324
It's impossible to decline this blessing.

230
00:29:28,259 --> 00:29:32,259
The threat of Togay that Geyhatu sent
after us...

231
00:29:32,259 --> 00:29:36,259
is known by you.

232
00:29:36,259 --> 00:29:40,259
He sent a killer
to kill me in my tribe...

233
00:29:40,259 --> 00:29:46,459
and he is with him
instead of the taxes he expected.

234
00:29:46,459 --> 00:29:51,159
We expect him to attack from somewhere.

235
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:57,930
Don't worry, Osman Bey.
Our sultan is informed.

236
00:29:57,930 --> 00:30:02,830
He made an agreement with the Mongols
to not attack you.

237
00:30:05,492 --> 00:30:09,492
It seems that our sultan approves
the answer...

238
00:30:09,492 --> 00:30:12,972
that Osman Bey gave to the
attack he received.

239
00:30:12,972 --> 00:30:17,492
Gündüz Bey, you know how it is.

240
00:30:17,492 --> 00:30:22,422
It isn't about a messenger but
the fact that Osman Bey doesn't pay taxes.

241
00:30:22,634 --> 00:30:27,174
This needs to be resolved at once.

242
00:30:29,804 --> 00:30:35,644
If our sultan wants to act considering
the interests...

243
00:30:35,644 --> 00:30:39,644
of the Kayı tribe...

244
00:30:39,644 --> 00:30:43,644
if he assures that Kayı tribe...

245
00:30:43,644 --> 00:30:47,804
will not be harmed...

246
00:30:49,454 --> 00:30:53,454
Then...
Then...

247
00:30:53,454 --> 00:30:57,454
it is a duty to answer to his call.

248
00:31:05,263 --> 00:31:09,263
Osman Bey...

249
00:31:09,263 --> 00:31:13,263
be at ease now.

250
00:31:13,263 --> 00:31:17,263
If your life is under the protection of
our sultan.

251
00:31:17,659 --> 00:31:21,659
Until you safely return to your tribe...

252
00:31:21,659 --> 00:31:25,659
we'll keep our hands on our
swords...

253
00:31:25,659 --> 00:31:31,159
and we'll wait for your news.

254
00:31:41,741 --> 00:31:48,101
It is true what I heard about the Kayı
Tribe. Now I've seen it with my eyes.

255
00:31:51,259 --> 00:31:54,789
With the name of Allah.

256
00:31:55,868 --> 00:31:59,868
Enjoy your meals.

257
00:32:23,513 --> 00:32:28,463
For this flag that my ancestors left...

258
00:32:28,463 --> 00:32:31,482
for this flag that...

259
00:32:31,482 --> 00:32:36,202
many of my ghazis
and martyrs have their blood on...

260
00:32:36,841 --> 00:32:42,531
I struggled a lot. To not let this
flag fall down...

261
00:32:42,531 --> 00:32:49,131
I fought to the death with the
most vicious enemies.

262
00:32:49,925 --> 00:32:53,925
But...

263
00:32:53,925 --> 00:32:59,005
no support or whatsoever...

264
00:32:59,005 --> 00:33:03,695
All on our own, we came to these
days by fighting.

265
00:33:05,454 --> 00:33:09,454
And from now, we'll still
be on be our own.

266
00:33:09,875 --> 00:33:14,745
Osman Bey is given the robe
of honor.

267
00:33:14,745 --> 00:33:19,455
Osman Bey is invited.

268
00:33:23,773 --> 00:33:28,703
My Bey, our sultan giving you
the robe of honor...

269
00:33:28,703 --> 00:33:32,703
sending you an invite is equal
to facing the Mongol.

270
00:33:32,703 --> 00:33:38,203
How can he dare to face
the Mongols?

271
00:33:42,488 --> 00:33:45,408
And haven't you heard the man, my bey?

272
00:33:45,408 --> 00:33:50,488
Emir didn't mention the battles Osman
Bey has done with Togay.

273
00:33:50,488 --> 00:33:54,488
The compliment he is getting is
for the victory against the Rum heathens.

274
00:33:55,973 --> 00:34:00,313
Maybe you are right, Malhun.

275
00:34:01,683 --> 00:34:05,683
But Osman Bey's influence...

276
00:34:05,683 --> 00:34:09,683
on Turkmen tribes is increasing.

277
00:34:12,997 --> 00:34:16,997
I will show them what
jihad means...

278
00:34:16,997 --> 00:34:20,997
what beating the heathens means...

279
00:34:20,997 --> 00:34:24,997
they'll learn.
Now...

280
00:34:24,997 --> 00:34:28,997
it is time to make a move!

281
00:34:39,011 --> 00:34:44,621
Your reputation is spreading.
Your name is heard from Konya, Osman Bey.

282
00:34:50,878 --> 00:34:55,868
-Do you think that dark clouds are gone?
-They will.

283
00:34:55,985 --> 00:34:59,435
For sure, Bala.

284
00:34:59,435 --> 00:35:03,435
Good days are at our door.

285
00:35:05,706 --> 00:35:09,456
Inshallah.

286
00:35:15,014 --> 00:35:19,014
There is something gnawing you, Bala.

287
00:35:20,031 --> 00:35:24,031
Don't you know, Osman?

288
00:35:24,418 --> 00:35:28,418
Don't you know the trouble
that has no cure?

289
00:35:29,083 --> 00:35:33,683
I remember it every time you
talk about good days.

290
00:35:35,468 --> 00:35:41,898
If we won't have children,
how will we have good days?

291
00:35:44,118 --> 00:35:48,738
This is the only question I don't
know the answer of.

292
00:35:50,179 --> 00:35:54,799
This is the only enemy that
I'm helpless against.

293
00:35:57,600 --> 00:36:03,540
It's not that hard, Osman.
You'll have a worthy wife.

294
00:36:04,187 --> 00:36:08,187
You will have an heir.

295
00:36:11,469 --> 00:36:16,349
-But I--
-I don't call the trouble my enemy.

296
00:36:16,448 --> 00:36:21,728
Every bey has an enemy.
But the trouble in your heart...

297
00:36:23,213 --> 00:36:27,213
that leaves me helpless.

298
00:36:29,219 --> 00:36:34,049
The fact that you will be sad
ties my hands.

299
00:36:35,317 --> 00:36:39,317
You have such a beautiful heart.

300
00:36:39,807 --> 00:36:43,807
May Allah give you everything you want.

301
00:37:14,865 --> 00:37:18,445
Bala...

302
00:38:17,772 --> 00:38:23,372
Amin. Amin.
Inshallah, Bala.

303
00:38:25,747 --> 00:38:28,967
Amin.

304
00:38:57,995 --> 00:39:03,395
Brother. The tribe is
under your protection.

305
00:39:08,246 --> 00:39:13,436
Even if he is an emir of the Seljuks,
you can't trust the Mongols.

306
00:39:13,837 --> 00:39:18,177
Don't worry, Osman Bey.
We protect the tribe.

307
00:39:18,177 --> 00:39:22,827
-Godspeed.
-Thank you, brother.

308
00:39:24,622 --> 00:39:31,342
Osman Bey... Osman Bey...
Konya is as much as in chaos as here.

309
00:39:31,686 --> 00:39:36,816
Be careful.
Be careful.

310
00:39:39,342 --> 00:39:43,342
May Allah accompany you.

311
00:39:43,342 --> 00:39:47,852
Thank you, Bamsı Bey.
Thank you.

312
00:41:21,200 --> 00:41:22,740
You should go now.

313
00:41:26,518 --> 00:41:28,298
Take care of yourself.

314
00:41:29,630 --> 00:41:32,330
Osman Bey will notice your absence.
Go now.

315
00:41:33,337 --> 00:41:35,857
Boran!
Go.

316
00:41:36,810 --> 00:41:39,820
You are pretty when you are angry, Gonca.

317
00:41:41,490 --> 00:41:42,870
Go.

318
00:42:38,256 --> 00:42:44,106
Osman dismissed your messenger, and
destroyed your dignity, I've heard.

319
00:42:45,848 --> 00:42:49,658
It would be a lie if I said I'm sorry.

320
00:42:51,101 --> 00:42:53,961
I warned you Togay.

321
00:42:54,408 --> 00:42:56,553
But you didn't listen to me.

322
00:42:56,553 --> 00:43:02,923
I'll leave none alive when the time comes,
Nicola.

323
00:43:03,445 --> 00:43:05,905
You are all alone now.

324
00:43:08,368 --> 00:43:15,728
Now that you think there's a right time,
I'll just sit in my corner and watch you.

325
00:43:16,686 --> 00:43:22,196
Seljuqi Sultan will punish Osman, not me.

326
00:43:22,595 --> 00:43:26,269
Since when Seljuqi Sultan has been
dealing with Beys?

327
00:43:26,269 --> 00:43:29,009
I am not intrested in your politics.

328
00:43:29,116 --> 00:43:31,756
Either Yarhisar Lord pays his taxes...

329
00:43:32,119 --> 00:43:35,169
or I'll handle it with my soldiers.

330
00:43:36,007 --> 00:43:40,417
Yarhisar Castle's walls will be
his graveyard.

331
00:43:46,912 --> 00:43:50,012
You are taking it all out on us...

332
00:43:51,044 --> 00:43:53,924
because you couldn't storm at Osman?

333
00:44:01,184 --> 00:44:05,304
I am not taking my anger out of anyone,
Nicola.

334
00:44:05,680 --> 00:44:08,879
We had an agreement, if you remember.

335
00:44:08,879 --> 00:44:12,399
Yason can't pay his taxes unless...

336
00:44:13,717 --> 00:44:16,337
Osman pays you.

337
00:44:16,679 --> 00:44:19,189
There's no agreement.

338
00:44:20,987 --> 00:44:25,647
I'll collect tax from Yarhisar Lord
myself.

339
00:44:26,449 --> 00:44:30,729
You are very impatient.
I'll talk to Yason.

340
00:44:31,125 --> 00:44:34,065
This is Yason's last chance, Nicola.

341
00:44:34,556 --> 00:44:39,776
Your dignity is going to be vanished
when I...

342
00:44:40,724 --> 00:44:45,184
stick his pathetic head in my spear
in front of Yarhisar Castle's walls.

343
00:44:49,532 --> 00:44:52,652
Do I make myself clear, Nicola?

344
00:45:03,805 --> 00:45:05,475
Open the door!

345
00:45:06,676 --> 00:45:08,956
Perfectly clear, Togay.

346
00:45:10,534 --> 00:45:13,384
Perfectly clear.

347
00:45:18,177 --> 00:45:21,947
Are we going to do whatever
those vandals want?

348
00:45:23,673 --> 00:45:29,083
I remind you, Nicola. They retreated
even though we had an agreement.

349
00:45:29,837 --> 00:45:32,711
He wants to go to Yason.

350
00:45:32,711 --> 00:45:37,471
His feet will not be
carrying his stupid head.

351
00:45:37,649 --> 00:45:42,949
Togay underestimated me.
He'll pay dearly.

352
00:45:43,248 --> 00:45:49,818
He didn't attack Osman. Alright,
we'll hit Togay then.

353
00:45:49,903 --> 00:45:53,203
- Our soldiers are not enough.
- Helen!

354
00:45:55,892 --> 00:45:58,872
We'll collaborate with Togay's enemy.

355
00:46:00,446 --> 00:46:03,446
- Who?
- Who.

356
00:46:13,480 --> 00:46:15,550
Umur Bey.

357
00:46:15,843 --> 00:46:21,683
My enemy's enemy is my friend.

358
00:46:26,341 --> 00:46:29,141
Are you still here, Helen?

359
00:46:29,728 --> 00:46:34,578
Inform Umur Bey that I want to host
him in my castle.

360
00:46:35,110 --> 00:46:37,190
With a great pleasure, sir.

361
00:47:11,277 --> 00:47:14,937
Dimos, where are you hurrily off to?

362
00:47:20,836 --> 00:47:23,938
Are you sure Dimos is in service of
Yarhisar Lord?

363
00:47:23,938 --> 00:47:28,198
He was always in his service.
He even did his dirty jobs.

364
00:47:28,962 --> 00:47:30,552
I'm sure.

365
00:47:31,428 --> 00:47:35,838
I shudder to think that he can betray
Osman Bey, Cerkutay.

366
00:47:46,693 --> 00:47:49,753
Let's see how much
you can endure.

367
00:47:51,031 --> 00:47:56,891
Let's see what you're going to tell us
when we rip your skin out of your bones.

368
00:48:07,799 --> 00:48:12,849
He feels like in his barn when he
is in battlefield.

369
00:48:13,406 --> 00:48:16,026
He helps his rider fight in war.

370
00:48:19,541 --> 00:48:24,341
He is a brave and stubborn horse.

371
00:48:25,166 --> 00:48:28,916
He is elegant with his beauty.

372
00:48:29,450 --> 00:48:33,750
He is fast and tough.

373
00:48:34,091 --> 00:48:37,981
He has more than every characteristics
one horse should have.

374
00:48:38,521 --> 00:48:40,391
Can he breed?

375
00:48:41,064 --> 00:48:45,174
The filly he mated will give birth
next month.

376
00:48:45,442 --> 00:48:50,142
Nicola, let me gift him to you.

377
00:48:53,141 --> 00:48:57,631
Osman dismissed Togay's messenger who
he sent to collect tax.

378
00:48:58,004 --> 00:49:02,474
Sultan Mesut promoted Osman instead of
call Osman to account.

379
00:49:02,603 --> 00:49:07,873
I don't know what kind of politics is this
in Konya but I'm sick of it, Umur Bey.

380
00:49:08,885 --> 00:49:12,135
Osman's star is shining in Sultan's eyes.

381
00:49:12,818 --> 00:49:15,758
What are you trying to tell me, Nicola?

382
00:49:16,284 --> 00:49:19,744
- Togay.
- What happened to that dog?

383
00:49:19,882 --> 00:49:23,082
That vandal, that arrogant Shaman...

384
00:49:23,514 --> 00:49:26,556
is your and my common enemy.

385
00:49:26,556 --> 00:49:31,767
He will finish what he has left unfinished
as he follows you.

386
00:49:31,767 --> 00:49:37,027
Do not forget: He troubled us all
because he wanted to call you to account

387
00:49:37,873 --> 00:49:39,803
for what you've done in Anatolia.

388
00:49:39,840 --> 00:49:44,270
I pray every day to face that dog.

389
00:49:44,958 --> 00:49:47,185
Your prayer is accepted.

390
00:49:47,185 --> 00:49:54,385
Osman the shining star on one hand, Togay
who is shackled by Sultan on the other hand.

391
00:49:54,727 --> 00:49:58,897
Togay's death will not only glorify you,
Umur Bey.

392
00:49:58,897 --> 00:50:02,797
It will also be enough to kill
Osman's star.

393
00:50:03,540 --> 00:50:08,350
But if I have a decent Bey who has...

394
00:50:09,034 --> 00:50:12,354
decent horses, decent riders and alps...

395
00:50:13,058 --> 00:50:16,038
on my side, then we can end Togay.

396
00:50:16,498 --> 00:50:22,508
However, I am not sure if you
partner up with me...

397
00:50:23,122 --> 00:50:25,432
without informing Osman Bey.

398
00:50:25,747 --> 00:50:28,867
I and Osman Bey are not responsible
for each other.

399
00:50:28,940 --> 00:50:31,670
Tell me how.

400
00:50:35,370 --> 00:50:40,230
I'll give you a secret, Umur Bey.
You know I trust you.

401
00:50:42,283 --> 00:50:44,253
I am listening to you, tell me.

402
00:50:44,362 --> 00:50:48,292
We are sick of Togay troubling
my soldiers.

403
00:50:48,801 --> 00:50:53,611
A decent Bey and his alps on my side
would end Togay.

404
00:50:55,487 --> 00:51:01,447
I understand your idea.
Now that you think I'm decent...

405
00:51:01,993 --> 00:51:04,221
I want to hear your plan.

406
00:51:04,221 --> 00:51:06,391
Here is my plan...

407
00:51:06,934 --> 00:51:11,454
Togay will go to Yarhisar Lord to
collect his taxes.

408
00:51:12,622 --> 00:51:18,632
In the moment he least expected, your
valiant alps and my soldiers entrap him.

409
00:51:20,721 --> 00:51:23,651
Then my prayers will be accepted.

410
00:51:24,601 --> 00:51:28,428
Your dignity will improve in
Turkish tents.

411
00:51:28,428 --> 00:51:35,448
Osman can rest in your shade,
Umur Bey.

412
00:51:36,097 --> 00:51:41,717
When will Togay set off to
Lord Yason?

413
00:51:43,011 --> 00:51:47,931
Let's talk about these in dinner, Umur Bey.

414
00:52:11,855 --> 00:52:13,735
Don't resist!

415
00:52:43,119 --> 00:52:46,593
You had Melih killed, huh?

416
00:52:46,593 --> 00:52:48,943
Yes, yes.

417
00:53:05,135 --> 00:53:09,555
You have to give me proper information...

418
00:53:10,069 --> 00:53:13,216
or I'll drown you in the water.

419
00:53:13,216 --> 00:53:17,419
- This is all I know.
- This is all you know.

420
00:53:17,419 --> 00:53:19,909
Is this all you know?

421
00:53:31,252 --> 00:53:34,892
I can't hear you?
Can't hear you?

422
00:53:36,645 --> 00:53:42,405
Nicola will partner up with Lord Yason
and attack Togay.

423
00:53:55,964 --> 00:53:59,084
If you're lying, what am I going
to do with you?

424
00:53:59,864 --> 00:54:03,934
Swear to god, swear to god.
I am telling the truth.

425
00:54:11,325 --> 00:54:14,415
We'll see.
We'll see.

426
00:54:15,396 --> 00:54:18,376
We'll see if you are right.
Alps!

427
00:54:21,150 --> 00:54:24,220
Take him to caged tent.

428
00:54:24,866 --> 00:54:26,406
Go.

429
00:54:29,143 --> 00:54:30,153
Go!

430
00:54:32,364 --> 00:54:33,664
Go!

431
00:54:43,641 --> 00:54:46,021
Come son, come.

432
00:54:51,658 --> 00:54:53,448
Did you hear him, Bamsı Bey?

433
00:54:53,917 --> 00:54:55,817
Old friends became enemies.

434
00:54:57,733 --> 00:55:01,645
That's okay, let them
fight each other.

435
00:55:01,645 --> 00:55:03,505
It's good for us.

436
00:55:04,233 --> 00:55:10,563
But son, Nicola must has someting
else in his mind. He can't defeat Togay.

437
00:55:12,805 --> 00:55:14,775
I won't kill him Bamsı Bey.

438
00:55:16,034 --> 00:55:19,254
We'll take care of him when Osman Bey comes back.

439
00:55:22,735 --> 00:55:27,885
We are going through an era in which we
don't know who is friend and who's enemy.

440
00:55:31,435 --> 00:55:34,105
What are we going to do with the
refugees Bamsı Bey?

441
00:55:34,131 --> 00:55:37,471
How will we understand who is
traitor and who is not?

442
00:55:37,966 --> 00:55:41,166
Son, every one of them is our guest.

443
00:55:41,236 --> 00:55:43,666
We won't discriminate.

444
00:55:44,089 --> 00:55:50,659
We need to host them, Also, we
need to keep an eye on them.

445
00:55:54,242 --> 00:55:57,432
One trouble comes over another.

446
00:55:58,418 --> 00:56:04,078
Yes son. Big guys have big problems.

447
00:56:04,577 --> 00:56:08,737
Osman Bey's troubles will get bigger
as he grows.

448
00:56:09,888 --> 00:56:14,588
But son, he'll get over every difficulty...

449
00:56:14,791 --> 00:56:20,581
as he has a brother like you.

450
00:56:21,405 --> 00:56:24,275
Eyvallah, Bamsı Bey, Eyvallah (thank you).

451
00:56:30,888 --> 00:56:34,548
I'll take you to Sultan's presence
in the morning.

452
00:56:34,903 --> 00:56:38,443
Now you should rest.
You had a long trip.

453
00:56:38,615 --> 00:56:39,565
Tell me.

454
00:56:48,371 --> 00:56:50,801
What is Sultan like?

455
00:56:52,086 --> 00:56:57,876
Sultan Mesut was a hope for the people who
had no peace for a long time.

456
00:56:58,775 --> 00:57:05,565
What about now? Is he depended to
Mongol governors?

457
00:57:06,214 --> 00:57:12,674
Osman Bey, as you know, since Mongols
arrived, taxes are heavier.

458
00:57:13,155 --> 00:57:18,305
There is famine.
Our Sultan is trying to sustain the state.

459
00:57:19,645 --> 00:57:23,165
He hopes to unite when Mongols
leave someday.

460
00:57:24,814 --> 00:57:28,134
He is dealing with self ordained Beys
like you.

461
00:57:29,343 --> 00:57:32,163
You shall rest now.

462
00:57:58,080 --> 00:58:02,600
We had a long trip Boran. Bey told us to
get a proper rest.

463
00:58:02,674 --> 00:58:04,724
Close your eyes.

464
00:58:12,168 --> 00:58:14,478
I can't sleep brother.

465
00:58:17,980 --> 00:58:19,660
What are you thinking?

466
00:58:20,746 --> 00:58:26,970
I am thinking about the great Seljuqs,
the glorious palace in which...

467
00:58:26,970 --> 00:58:30,070
Sultan Aladdin had lived.

468
00:58:30,902 --> 00:58:34,122
- Now...
- What now?

469
00:58:34,599 --> 00:58:38,929
I see the palace is under the shadow of...

470
00:58:39,265 --> 00:58:42,095
randy Mongol soldiers.

471
00:58:43,496 --> 00:58:46,616
I am afraid that this Palace swallow
my Osman Bey.

472
00:58:47,292 --> 00:58:49,382
I am uneasy.

473
00:58:51,856 --> 00:58:55,828
This comfy bed is like a bog for me.

474
00:58:56,328 --> 00:58:59,128
Okay then brother.
What are we waiting for?

475
00:58:59,239 --> 00:59:00,709
Let's go.

476
00:59:19,207 --> 00:59:21,107
Our Bey is staying in this room.

477
00:59:22,306 --> 00:59:25,176
Then we wait our Bey here.

478
00:59:35,635 --> 00:59:37,775
Are you at ease now, my Boran?

479
00:59:38,774 --> 00:59:41,184
I am, brother.

480
00:59:55,178 --> 00:59:59,258
We'll hit that dog Togay who wanted to
attack us when we just landed in here...

481
00:59:59,258 --> 01:00:03,738
who shed our blood...

482
01:00:03,738 --> 01:00:07,818
in the moment he least expected.

483
01:00:08,622 --> 01:00:13,102
My Bey, is it right to do this
without telling Osman Bey?

484
01:00:13,851 --> 01:00:19,561
We partner up with Nicola to attack
Togay. It's politics, Malhun.

485
01:00:20,706 --> 01:00:25,936
Besides, I won't have permission from
Osman Bey to attack my enemy!

486
01:00:42,163 --> 01:00:43,713
Alps!

487
01:00:46,354 --> 01:00:48,804
I see you didn't sleep in the night.

488
01:00:52,222 --> 01:00:57,292
We decided to sacrifice our sleep
with Goktug, my Bey.

489
01:01:00,217 --> 01:01:03,097
You did the same, as I can see, my Bey.

490
01:01:04,771 --> 01:01:08,521
We were afraid that they'd attempt
something, my Bey.

491
01:01:08,521 --> 01:01:11,721
There are so many Mongols in the Palace.

492
01:01:20,650 --> 01:01:22,830
Our Sultan is waiting for you Osman Bey.

493
01:01:23,396 --> 01:01:24,896
Okay.

494
01:01:25,770 --> 01:01:28,769
Alps, bring the present.

495
01:01:28,769 --> 01:01:30,749
Don't bother.

496
01:01:40,505 --> 01:01:42,415
We shall go.

497
01:02:49,542 --> 01:02:53,522
Osman Bey wants to come in
our Sultan's presence.

498
01:02:55,053 --> 01:02:58,393
Deliver your swords first.

499
01:03:26,901 --> 01:03:30,311
You have to lean while going in, my Bey.

500
01:03:33,189 --> 01:03:36,129
Do not talk without Sultan's permission.

501
01:03:36,405 --> 01:03:39,384
Do not look in the eye of Sultan
while talking.

502
01:03:39,384 --> 01:03:41,364
This is tradition.

503
01:03:43,927 --> 01:03:47,347
Our Sultan is the other side of the doors.

504
01:03:50,743 --> 01:03:52,503
Doors!

505
01:04:00,210 --> 01:04:04,290
Kayı Bey Ertugrul Ghazi's son Osman Bey.

506
01:04:51,448 --> 01:04:53,558
You brought presents, Osman Bey.

507
01:04:54,989 --> 01:05:00,229
I wanted to return my Sultan's favor.

508
01:05:01,526 --> 01:05:07,016
In these chests, there are other Turk
Beys' presents too.

509
01:05:16,361 --> 01:05:17,891
What is this?

510
01:05:21,010 --> 01:05:28,346
This is Sultan Aladdin's present for my father.
He sit in this throne long before you did.

511
01:05:46,120 --> 01:05:50,080
Why are you giving this precious gift
of Sultan to me?

512
01:05:51,552 --> 01:05:56,852
The value of this present is not about
its valued rocks on it.

513
01:05:59,304 --> 01:06:05,964
it's about how great our state is, which
was revived by Sultan Aladdin.

514
01:06:10,439 --> 01:06:12,419
I wanted you to keep it.

515
01:06:12,793 --> 01:06:18,243
So that you always remember...

516
01:06:19,707 --> 01:06:22,947
how great your state is.

517
01:06:41,056 --> 01:06:42,966
Judge of Governor.

518
01:06:59,953 --> 01:07:04,393
So, Gokboru Osman is you...

519
01:07:05,295 --> 01:07:09,145
who is self ordained, who Togay
was talking about.

520
01:07:33,852 --> 01:07:37,812
There's something wrong Boran,
be ready.

521
01:07:38,413 --> 01:07:41,833
He entered the room without permission.

522
01:07:43,218 --> 01:07:48,558
Brother, let this life be haram(banned)
to us...

523
01:07:48,691 --> 01:07:51,501
if we can't kill at least ten men
for each of us.

524
01:07:52,915 --> 01:07:55,265
Agreed, brother.

525
01:08:03,431 --> 01:08:08,141
Judge of governor, you honored us.

526
01:08:12,293 --> 01:08:17,053
I have things to ask Osman Bey.

527
01:08:21,393 --> 01:08:27,223
You promised to be Togay's city,
but you killed my messenger.

528
01:08:28,688 --> 01:08:32,738
Do you know what this costs
to you, Osman Bey?

529
01:08:34,193 --> 01:08:38,813
I want to know what this is about,
Osman Bey!

530
01:08:39,310 --> 01:08:44,134
The sneaky one they sent as messenger
tried to kill me...

531
01:08:44,954 --> 01:08:48,294
with his dagger.

532
01:08:51,527 --> 01:08:53,597
You are lying!

533
01:08:54,099 --> 01:08:59,049
My Sultan, I think Togay lost
his temper and killed him...

534
01:08:59,239 --> 01:09:04,759
after I sent him back to Togay.

535
01:09:07,168 --> 01:09:10,808
Go ask Togay.

536
01:09:12,031 --> 01:09:16,861
I protected my tribe's honor,
and my own life as a Bey.

537
01:09:17,847 --> 01:09:22,097
I forgived his life while I should have
killed him.

538
01:09:25,192 --> 01:09:28,922
The rest does not concern me.

539
01:09:29,842 --> 01:09:35,661
Did my messenger tried to kill you when he
heard you wasn't giving taxes?

540
01:09:35,661 --> 01:09:41,551
My Sultan, as you know,
we don't kill the messenger.

541
01:09:42,023 --> 01:09:45,793
What about taxes?

542
01:09:47,694 --> 01:09:55,564
Do you want me to come to your tent,
shed your blood and collect taxes Osman Bey?

543
01:09:57,479 --> 01:10:03,769
If you be a rebel and don't pay your tax..

544
01:10:03,861 --> 01:10:09,051
It'll be my mission to
take your wealth and your life, Osman Bey.

545
01:10:28,374 --> 01:10:33,924
Do not do something wrong.

546
01:10:36,129 --> 01:10:41,099
Do not make me kill a noble Bey
of my own race.

547
01:10:45,277 --> 01:10:50,487
I told Osman Bey what I had to tell. You
have anything to say, judge of governor?

548
01:10:51,863 --> 01:10:58,033
Maybe it's the best thing to end
Gokboru here...

549
01:10:58,522 --> 01:11:02,722
before he bites my soldiers.

550
01:11:07,464 --> 01:11:12,434
Crushing Gokboru's head
while he is little...

551
01:11:14,126 --> 01:11:16,886
or not?

552
01:11:17,810 --> 01:11:21,970
Geyhatu's request is clear...

553
01:11:21,995 --> 01:11:23,965
Judge of governor.

554
01:11:25,622 --> 01:11:29,622
First taxes, then regulation.

555
01:11:29,890 --> 01:11:33,240
You have to obey for both.

556
01:11:40,456 --> 01:11:45,206
You saved your life with gold, Osman Bey.

557
01:11:45,601 --> 01:11:48,021
Thank to your Sultan.

558
01:11:48,793 --> 01:11:53,103
Pay your tax to Togay immediately.

559
01:11:54,120 --> 01:11:55,750
Judge!

560
01:12:04,325 --> 01:12:06,405
I will not pay it to Togay.

561
01:12:11,147 --> 01:12:13,437
I'll pay it to my Sultan.

562
01:12:17,304 --> 01:12:20,834
I am responsible for this, judge.

563
01:12:21,137 --> 01:12:25,317
I am not intrested in the source of money.

564
01:12:25,687 --> 01:12:28,537
I want it to be paid on time.

565
01:12:29,493 --> 01:12:34,233
But, if I don't have it on time...

566
01:12:34,577 --> 01:12:39,139
then, I'll hold you responsible...

567
01:12:39,139 --> 01:12:43,129
for everything, Sultan Mesut.

568
01:12:55,068 --> 01:12:57,558
Do you have anything else to say,
Osman Bey?

569
01:13:05,976 --> 01:13:08,686
Sultan Aladdin's dagger...

570
01:13:11,238 --> 01:13:13,998
is in the wrong person.

571
01:13:20,737 --> 01:13:22,887
Excuse me, my Sultan.

572
01:13:23,011 --> 01:13:26,921
- Osman Bey...
- Everything has been said, my Sultan.

573
01:13:30,515 --> 01:13:33,665
Heart speaks when your tongue can't.

574
01:13:37,406 --> 01:13:38,996
From now on...

575
01:13:40,951 --> 01:13:43,741
the rest is up to Allah.

576
01:13:58,416 --> 01:14:01,496
- My Bey...
- Let's go back to tent at once.

577
01:14:16,461 --> 01:14:18,511
Can I come in my bey?

578
01:14:18,522 --> 01:14:20,172
Come!

579
01:14:27,530 --> 01:14:28,670
My Bey.

580
01:14:29,747 --> 01:14:31,317
From Nicola.

581
01:14:45,872 --> 01:14:47,662
What does Nicola say, my Bey?

582
01:14:49,162 --> 01:14:54,242
He says Togay will collect tax
from Yarhisar.

583
01:14:55,629 --> 01:14:59,039
Nicola knows his path.

584
01:14:59,855 --> 01:15:03,218
- He wants to attack him on his way.
- What are we going to do my Bey?

585
01:15:03,218 --> 01:15:07,889
What do you mean what are we
going to do? Inform my alps!

586
01:15:07,889 --> 01:15:11,779
We'll unsheath our swords for revenge!

587
01:15:12,374 --> 01:15:14,254
As you order, my bey.

588
01:15:20,166 --> 01:15:25,156
My bey, are you sure?
What if it's Nikola's plan?

589
01:15:25,173 --> 01:15:29,703
Don't worry. We'll take our measures
accordingly.

590
01:16:00,818 --> 01:16:03,788
I knew that they would
do mischief, my bey.

591
01:16:15,042 --> 01:16:16,612
Beware!

592
01:16:26,323 --> 01:16:27,883
Alps.

593
01:16:29,094 --> 01:16:31,294
Sheathe your swords.

594
01:16:43,668 --> 01:16:45,738
What coincidence is this, Osman Bey?

595
01:16:46,941 --> 01:16:49,391
I thought you left the palace.

596
01:16:54,500 --> 01:16:57,910
If it's the last time we
encounter each other...

597
01:16:58,836 --> 01:17:02,246
I want to talk to you personally.

598
01:17:05,024 --> 01:17:06,964
Come with me.

599
01:17:27,830 --> 01:17:32,550
Alps. Keep your eyes on the soldiers.

600
01:17:33,685 --> 01:17:36,035
- Alright, my bey.
- Alright, my bey.

601
01:17:40,262 --> 01:17:41,982
What is this sultan doing?

602
01:17:44,235 --> 01:17:48,685
Patience, brother.
Have patience.

603
01:17:49,381 --> 01:17:52,821
Patience until Osman bey
establishes the state.

604
01:18:01,971 --> 01:18:05,601
I know how you defeated Lord Nikola.

605
01:18:06,109 --> 01:18:13,299
You proved that you are a great bey
just like your father.

606
01:18:20,920 --> 01:18:27,270
Know that I want you to be loyal to
my ancestor Aladdin's memory.

607
01:18:28,335 --> 01:18:33,615
I'm doing everything I can to protect
you and your tribe from the Mongols.

608
01:18:34,013 --> 01:18:38,403
Don't put yourself or me
in a difficult spot.

609
01:18:40,145 --> 01:18:44,925
My respect for you and my loyalty
to the past...

610
01:18:45,632 --> 01:18:47,982
has a limit.

611
01:18:48,772 --> 01:18:53,404
And that limit is the tax of the Mongols.

612
01:18:53,404 --> 01:18:55,104
I know.

613
01:19:00,630 --> 01:19:05,420
Karamanoğulları is preparing
to move against me.

614
01:19:05,608 --> 01:19:08,588
The claim my throne.

615
01:19:08,927 --> 01:19:13,027
The topliners of the city are in
a difficult situation.

616
01:19:13,400 --> 01:19:18,730
My brother will come to Konya
from Kayseri with his forces.

617
01:19:21,987 --> 01:19:27,697
These are all measures I'm taking
to...

618
01:19:27,898 --> 01:19:32,908
protect the state of my
ancestor Aladdin, Osman Bey.

619
01:19:35,258 --> 01:19:40,158
Will the incoming army be enough
to stop the Karamanoğulları?

620
01:19:42,531 --> 01:19:44,361
What if it's not enough?

621
01:19:45,878 --> 01:19:50,048
I'll have to ask for Geyhatu's help.

622
01:19:53,497 --> 01:19:57,907
If Geyhatu comes, will he not
pillage the whole city?

623
01:19:59,126 --> 01:20:03,503
I neither have the strenght
to face the Mongols...

624
01:20:03,503 --> 01:20:05,583
nor the power.

625
01:20:05,583 --> 01:20:09,173
My only intention is to keep
my state alive.

626
01:20:10,327 --> 01:20:15,027
Otherwise, neither my state
nor your tribe will survive.

627
01:20:18,936 --> 01:20:24,336
Geyhatu's governor and Togay are
looking for an opportunity to kill you.

628
01:20:25,111 --> 01:20:28,721
I stopped both the governor and
Togay for now.

629
01:20:32,903 --> 01:20:34,743
At what cost?

630
01:20:37,351 --> 01:20:40,211
At the cost of my throne and blood.

631
01:20:40,692 --> 01:20:42,702
Don't forget that.

632
01:20:44,028 --> 01:20:50,208
Seemingly obeying the Mongols is
a condition for our state and your tribe.

633
01:20:51,257 --> 01:20:57,857
For this reason, staying patient for a
little longer benefits everyone.

634
01:21:03,680 --> 01:21:08,380
Do you say that we should gain power
enough to stand against the Mongols?

635
01:21:09,632 --> 01:21:14,552
There is no other way, Osman Bey.
I know that I'm right.

636
01:21:15,174 --> 01:21:18,534
I'll even send an army to support you.

637
01:21:20,515 --> 01:21:25,065
Of course, if you act wisely.

638
01:21:26,522 --> 01:21:29,152
Otherwise, we'll both lose.

639
01:21:31,506 --> 01:21:37,146
If the pillar of the state falls,
we'll all be crushed.

640
01:21:39,389 --> 01:21:41,879
I hope you understand.

641
01:21:44,514 --> 01:21:46,134
My eyes will be on Togay...

642
01:21:48,825 --> 01:21:51,655
and ears on you, my sultan.

643
01:21:53,435 --> 01:21:57,735
But know that, sheathing my sword...

644
01:21:59,929 --> 01:22:02,279
will not happen by my choice.

645
01:22:03,168 --> 01:22:06,508
Then, godspeed, Osman Bey.

646
01:22:07,013 --> 01:22:10,303
I'm at ease.
So should you.

647
01:22:14,971 --> 01:22:16,791
Thank you.

648
01:23:04,063 --> 01:23:06,593
Did the lords pay their taxes?

649
01:23:06,756 --> 01:23:10,386
They did, Togay.
We returned with gold.

650
01:23:45,185 --> 01:23:47,905
We'll go to Yasu.

651
01:23:48,658 --> 01:23:53,408
Nikola is very angry about that
I betrayed him.

652
01:23:53,697 --> 01:23:55,897
He'll seek vengeance.

653
01:23:56,470 --> 01:24:01,330
We'll be ready as the doomsday
will come.

654
01:24:02,386 --> 01:24:05,306
Yasu won't dare that.

655
01:24:13,695 --> 01:24:18,295
If he listens to Nikola
and set a trap...

656
01:24:19,127 --> 01:24:23,987
my grave will be his last
shelter.

657
01:24:24,884 --> 01:24:28,524
What about Osman?
What about your dark oath?

658
01:24:30,878 --> 01:24:34,758
The spirits have other
plans with the Gökbörü.

659
01:24:36,347 --> 01:24:42,597
Our hands are tied. We'll wait
until they are freed.

660
01:24:56,085 --> 01:25:01,025
The sultan wants us to keep
the act against the Mongols.

661
01:25:01,242 --> 01:25:04,962
The Kayıs will pay their taxes
to the Seljuks.

662
01:25:05,452 --> 01:25:07,092
Not to the Mongols.

663
01:25:08,653 --> 01:25:11,963
And he'll give soldiers?

664
01:25:15,545 --> 01:25:18,265
The Mongols will think that we
are their vassals.

665
01:25:18,289 --> 01:25:22,849
And we'll have the sultan's support...

666
01:25:23,684 --> 01:25:26,004
and gain strenght.

667
01:25:28,119 --> 01:25:34,309
If you get soldiers after the robe of honor,
you'll gain a lot of reputation, my bey.

668
01:25:35,682 --> 01:25:39,702
The Turkmen beys will be united
behind us.

669
01:25:40,419 --> 01:25:45,439
To stand stronger against
the armies of Ilkhaganete...

670
01:25:46,974 --> 01:25:49,184
this is what needs to be done.

671
01:25:51,257 --> 01:25:55,517
Now, I will send a
messenger to Togay.

672
01:25:56,753 --> 01:25:59,393
I will tell him that we obey him.

673
01:26:01,428 --> 01:26:07,098
That messenger will let him know that
we pay the taxes to the Seljuks.

674
01:26:09,218 --> 01:26:14,368
But Osman Bey, we know your
intentions...

675
01:26:14,533 --> 01:26:18,623
but being seen like
a vassal to the Mongols...

676
01:26:19,137 --> 01:26:21,997
will sow discontent
among other beys.

677
01:26:22,347 --> 01:26:25,997
I know, Osman Bey.
I know. I'll talk to every bey.

678
01:26:26,185 --> 01:26:29,095
I'll tell them all about it
and what we think.

679
01:26:29,345 --> 01:26:36,435
I'll go to Umur Bey who fought with
the Mongols a lot personally.

680
01:26:43,467 --> 01:26:48,657
-So, brother?
-We caught a traitor named Dimos here.

681
01:26:50,678 --> 01:26:53,558
We took an informant information
from him.

682
01:26:53,795 --> 01:26:58,635
The lord of Yarhisar and Nikola are
planning to attack Togay.

683
01:27:00,854 --> 01:27:06,064
Inshallah they won't leave the
battlefield until the last man.

684
01:27:07,156 --> 01:27:09,826
Inshallah, Bamsı Bey.
Inshallah.

685
01:27:11,603 --> 01:27:17,103
I will not attack Togay for the
deal I've made with the sultan.

686
01:27:19,632 --> 01:27:23,852
But if Nikola does...

687
01:27:24,404 --> 01:27:26,464
this will benefit me.

688
01:27:27,764 --> 01:27:32,904
Let them kill each other while
we gain power.

689
01:27:35,038 --> 01:27:39,188
When the time comes,
we'll crush them all.

690
01:27:41,711 --> 01:27:45,081
-Inshallah.
-Thank Allah.

691
01:27:55,393 --> 01:27:58,563
Togay will take this way to
collect the taxes.

692
01:27:59,205 --> 01:28:03,875
And I will wait for him here
with my army.

693
01:28:04,202 --> 01:28:08,252
And I will cut off his escape
from here.

694
01:28:09,146 --> 01:28:13,685
Umur Bey's alps will position here.

695
01:28:13,685 --> 01:28:15,945
Togay will be between three
forces.

696
01:28:15,958 --> 01:28:18,578
Not three, four.

697
01:28:19,696 --> 01:28:23,146
Your soldiers will attack from behind.

698
01:28:24,058 --> 01:28:29,448
Let's see if Togay's most trusted
spirits will save him from here.

699
01:28:39,216 --> 01:28:43,025
My bey, the poor people that
took refuge in our tribe...

700
01:28:43,025 --> 01:28:46,152
wanted to thank you for letting
them do their worship.

701
01:28:46,152 --> 01:28:49,162
They've been waiting for you
for a long time, my bey.

702
01:28:52,349 --> 01:28:55,306
Did you think about the kids?

703
01:28:55,306 --> 01:28:57,546
As you always order, my bey.

704
01:28:58,618 --> 01:29:00,238
Here, my bey.

705
01:29:01,735 --> 01:29:03,425
Thank you.

706
01:29:05,932 --> 01:29:07,372
Come on.

707
01:29:09,142 --> 01:29:12,822
Welcome, Osman Bey.
Welcome, Osman Bey.

708
01:29:13,571 --> 01:29:17,101
Thank you.
Thank you.

709
01:29:17,726 --> 01:29:20,666
Here it is.
Take some.

710
01:29:27,207 --> 01:29:28,507
Here.

711
01:29:31,463 --> 01:29:33,433
Mashallah.

712
01:29:33,929 --> 01:29:35,709
Mashallah.

713
01:29:43,432 --> 01:29:46,492
Not at all. Not at all.
Not at all.

714
01:29:52,863 --> 01:29:56,183
May Jesus Christ help you, Osman Bey.

715
01:29:56,206 --> 01:29:59,622
You opened your arms for us.
You gave us food.

716
01:29:59,622 --> 01:30:00,826
You gave us houses and a place
to pray.
You opened your arms for us.
You gave us food.

717
01:30:00,826 --> 01:30:04,902
You gave us houses and a place
to pray.

718
01:30:05,045 --> 01:30:09,895
-May Mother Mary watch over you.
-Thank you. Thank you.

719
01:30:10,520 --> 01:30:16,090
-Do you lack anything?
-We have everything, Osman Bey.

720
01:30:16,265 --> 01:30:20,265
Thank you, Osman Bey.
Thanks to you, Osman Bey.

721
01:30:20,265 --> 01:30:23,745
May God watch over you, Osman Bey.
We have everything, Osman Bey.

722
01:30:23,745 --> 01:30:29,265
-Does the church need anything?
-It has everything, Osman Bey.

723
01:30:29,265 --> 01:30:33,265
Thank you, Osman Bey.
God bless you, Osman Bey.

724
01:30:33,855 --> 01:30:40,045
If you need anything, come to me.

725
01:30:40,077 --> 01:30:46,787
Come to me. Now, you are our guests.

726
01:30:46,787 --> 01:30:51,447
If you feel comfortable,
so will we.

727
01:30:51,447 --> 01:30:56,947
Osman Bey, you call us guests but we
don't want to hear that word.

728
01:30:59,326 --> 01:31:03,326
Why is that? Tell me.

729
01:31:03,326 --> 01:31:07,746
We don't want to be guests but
persistent.

730
01:31:07,746 --> 01:31:13,646
We want to live under your flag, secured
by your justice.

731
01:31:15,529 --> 01:31:19,529
Mashallah.

732
01:31:23,037 --> 01:31:28,057
If so, you will not be called guests.

733
01:31:28,057 --> 01:31:32,057
Now, you are at home.

734
01:31:32,057 --> 01:31:36,057
Live as you want and
pray as you want.

735
01:31:36,057 --> 01:31:41,187
God bless you, Osman Bey.
God bless you, Osman Bey.

736
01:31:42,194 --> 01:31:46,194
Thank you. You too.

737
01:31:46,783 --> 01:31:50,783
You too.

738
01:32:16,686 --> 01:32:20,686
What's wrong, Cerkutay?
Had something happened at the tribe?

739
01:32:20,686 --> 01:32:25,866
Not at the tribe. Something is
happening in here! In here!

740
01:32:26,526 --> 01:32:32,326
The cure is here, Cerkutay. But our
sheik is resting.

741
01:32:35,230 --> 01:32:39,230
Tell him ''You said come here...

742
01:32:39,230 --> 01:32:43,230
and he came.''
He will understand.

743
01:32:46,328 --> 01:32:51,738
Come, Cerkutay.
Come. Let's not keep our sheik waiting.

744
01:33:00,126 --> 01:33:04,966
Two of the refugees were sick.
Now they are better.

745
01:33:05,271 --> 01:33:09,271
The herds are cadging now.

746
01:33:15,487 --> 01:33:19,487
Spring is coming, Osman.

747
01:33:19,850 --> 01:33:23,850
The people helped in foodbanks
are decreasing too.

748
01:33:24,679 --> 01:33:29,329
-Why, Bala?
-We are having less poor people, Osman Bey.

749
01:33:31,017 --> 01:33:37,197
Thank Allah.
Thank Allah.

750
01:33:42,171 --> 01:33:45,371
There was Hatice Hatun...

751
01:33:46,794 --> 01:33:51,814
she read Yasin surah to the women
at Bayhoca's funeral.

752
01:33:54,746 --> 01:34:00,376
Her daughter, Emine had a baby.
It was so cute--

753
01:34:09,055 --> 01:34:15,025
Why are you silent, my nightingale?
I can listen to you all day.

754
01:34:19,650 --> 01:34:24,680
I wish you could listen to the
sound of your children here.

755
01:34:31,159 --> 01:34:36,089
You still haven't done what
Ertuğrul Ghazi wanted, Osman Bey.

756
01:34:36,089 --> 01:34:42,339
-When you--
-It will happen as Allah wants.

757
01:34:43,785 --> 01:34:48,565
It will happen when Allah wants.

758
01:36:03,181 --> 01:36:10,711
O' valiant with a Muslim's heart!
What are you waiting for to convert?

759
01:36:12,297 --> 01:36:16,847
I'm a daemon.
I killed many.

760
01:36:16,847 --> 01:36:20,847
I killed women and children too.

761
01:36:23,791 --> 01:36:29,971
How can I be a Muslim?
I can't look at Muhammad.

762
01:36:33,337 --> 01:36:37,337
I'm afraid of his Allah.

763
01:36:37,519 --> 01:36:42,809
How can one be afraid of his loved one?
Just swear off.

764
01:36:42,809 --> 01:36:46,809
One who admits his tyranny can enter.

765
01:36:46,809 --> 01:36:51,869
Our door is open for them.

766
01:37:09,723 --> 01:37:16,153
Can you read me something from that book?

767
01:37:22,484 --> 01:37:26,484
I swear to mid-morning...

768
01:37:26,484 --> 01:37:31,784
I swear to midnight that...

769
01:37:32,028 --> 01:37:36,788
your Allah has not abandoned you.

770
01:37:36,788 --> 01:37:40,788
Neither is he offended.

771
01:37:40,788 --> 01:37:46,928
For sure, the afterlife is better
for you than this life.

772
01:37:47,203 --> 01:37:51,203
For sure, your Allah will give you...

773
01:37:51,203 --> 01:37:56,753
and you will be pleased.

774
01:38:00,292 --> 01:38:06,212
Did he not find you an orphan and
provided you shelter?

775
01:38:10,344 --> 01:38:17,134
Did he not find you lost and
gave you a path?

776
01:38:17,777 --> 01:38:24,267
Did he not find you in need
and make you rich?

777
01:38:28,902 --> 01:38:34,492
Then, don't oppress the orphans.

778
01:38:35,824 --> 01:38:41,424
Don't scold the ones who ask.

779
01:38:44,307 --> 01:38:48,307
And about the felicity of your Allah...

780
01:38:49,365 --> 01:38:53,365
talk about it.

781
01:38:53,731 --> 01:38:58,331
Is my Allah telling this to me?

782
01:38:58,701 --> 01:39:04,101
Your Allah is telling it to his
most beloved subject...

783
01:39:04,101 --> 01:39:08,961
Muhammad Mustafa.

784
01:39:14,937 --> 01:39:18,937
It's like he is telling me
as well.

785
01:39:18,937 --> 01:39:22,937
Understanding Qur-an is...

786
01:39:22,937 --> 01:39:28,677
understanding that we are object
of every subject in Qur-an, Cerkutay.

787
01:39:30,883 --> 01:39:34,883
And about the shada...

788
01:39:35,122 --> 01:39:39,122
shada...

789
01:39:39,122 --> 01:39:43,122
is the tears in your eyes.

790
01:39:44,641 --> 01:39:48,641
Witnessing that Allah is one and only...

791
01:39:48,641 --> 01:39:55,891
Hz.Muhammad is his subject and messenger..

792
01:39:55,891 --> 01:40:02,311
can only be done by feeling every verse
of Qur-an like this.

793
01:40:06,438 --> 01:40:12,648
I witness.
I witness.

794
01:40:14,030 --> 01:40:19,010
This religion is my religion.

795
01:40:26,031 --> 01:40:31,051
-Then repeat after me.
-I'm ready.

796
01:40:32,162 --> 01:40:37,722
I bear witness that there is no
god but Allah...

797
01:40:39,503 --> 01:40:45,433
I bear witness that there is no
god but Allah...

798
01:40:45,433 --> 01:40:52,383
and I bear witness that Muhammad
is the servant and Messenger of Allah.

799
01:40:52,383 --> 01:40:57,833
and I bear witness that Muhammad...

800
01:40:57,833 --> 01:41:01,833
-is the servant and...
-is the servant and...

801
01:41:01,833 --> 01:41:08,143
...Messenger of Allah.
...Messenger of Allah.

802
01:41:20,629 --> 01:41:24,629
With the name of Allah.

803
01:41:29,638 --> 01:41:34,718
You are among the Muslims.

804
01:42:00,857 --> 01:42:06,667
War is cheating, daughter.
Surprising the enemy assures victory.

805
01:42:06,667 --> 01:42:12,227
Togay doesn't expect us to attack.
So, he will be off guard.

806
01:42:12,589 --> 01:42:18,439
-There is someone else who doesn't expect.
-Is that so? Who is that?

807
01:42:18,539 --> 01:42:22,079
May I enter, Umur Bey?

808
01:42:22,079 --> 01:42:26,539
Come in, Osman Bey!

809
01:42:27,621 --> 01:42:33,221
-We would prepare if you had told us.
-Thank you, Umur Bey. Thank you.

810
01:42:34,571 --> 01:42:39,361
We had urgent jobs to take care of.

811
01:42:39,361 --> 01:42:44,041
I would like to eat with you
if we find time.

812
01:42:44,041 --> 01:42:48,041
Inshallah.
Come, Osman Bey.

813
01:42:58,422 --> 01:43:04,292
You know why I went to Konya,
Umur Bey.

814
01:43:04,292 --> 01:43:07,899
I know, Osman Bey.

815
01:43:07,899 --> 01:43:12,599
I wonder what you talked to our sultan.

816
01:43:13,749 --> 01:43:16,559
That's why I'm here.

817
01:43:18,145 --> 01:43:20,905
We agreed...

818
01:43:22,694 --> 01:43:26,694
with the sultan,
on the matter of...

819
01:43:26,694 --> 01:43:30,694
staying as vassals of the
Mongol for a little longer.

820
01:43:31,579 --> 01:43:35,579
I wanted you to hear it from me, Umur Bey.

821
01:43:38,223 --> 01:43:42,223
Hearing it directly from you...

822
01:43:42,223 --> 01:43:46,223
doesn't change our response.

823
01:43:46,223 --> 01:43:50,223
We migrated here, burying our
martyrs on the way.

824
01:43:50,223 --> 01:43:55,473
Not only our alps but our women and
children too!

825
01:43:55,473 --> 01:43:59,473
No one can ask me to be a vassal
of the Mongol...

826
01:43:59,473 --> 01:44:02,873
even if it's for the politics.

827
01:44:02,873 --> 01:44:08,863
Umur Bey, we've also had that.

828
01:44:09,976 --> 01:44:13,976
We came here while fighting
with the Mongols.

829
01:44:13,976 --> 01:44:18,796
Don't let our bow mistaken you.

830
01:44:18,796 --> 01:44:25,056
The bow is pulled now.
The arrow will find its target.

831
01:44:27,478 --> 01:44:31,478
You pull your bow and release
your arrow.

832
01:44:31,478 --> 01:44:35,478
And I will swing my blade.
Everyone will do as they know.

833
01:44:37,623 --> 01:44:41,623
Umur Bey.

834
01:44:41,623 --> 01:44:45,623
The sultan is talking about giving
soldiers.

835
01:44:46,462 --> 01:44:51,932
Think about it well.
Understand it.

836
01:44:52,696 --> 01:44:57,546
I'm not talking about a bunch of alps
but an army.

837
01:44:57,546 --> 01:45:01,546
I'm talking about facing the Ilkhaganete
army...

838
01:45:01,546 --> 01:45:05,546
not chasing Togay around.

839
01:45:05,722 --> 01:45:09,722
I'm not talking about saving
our tribes...

840
01:45:09,722 --> 01:45:12,912
but breaking the chains of
all Turkish tribes.

841
01:45:12,912 --> 01:45:19,272
Osman Bey, Sultan Mesut can't act unless
the Mongols order. You trust him too much.

842
01:45:19,526 --> 01:45:24,216
I'm determined on shaping the
fate of my tribe.

843
01:45:27,150 --> 01:45:33,410
Umur Bey! Being stubborn helps no one.

844
01:45:34,586 --> 01:45:39,706
If we don't act wise, all the
Turkmen tribes are in danger.

845
01:45:39,706 --> 01:45:44,506
Even Karamanoğulları and
Germiyanoğulları...

846
01:45:44,506 --> 01:45:48,506
are subjects of the Mongols.
Even the all Turkmen tribes...

847
01:45:48,506 --> 01:45:52,506
can't stand against
Ilkhaganate armies.

848
01:45:52,759 --> 01:45:56,759
I have a blood feud with Togay.

849
01:45:56,759 --> 01:46:00,759
I don't need anyone's help
to end that feud.

850
01:46:01,874 --> 01:46:07,146
Umur Bey!
Why is the haste, Umur Bey?

851
01:46:09,507 --> 01:46:13,507
Why is the haste?

852
01:46:13,507 --> 01:46:17,737
Nikola and the lord of Yarhisar will
attack Togay.

853
01:46:17,737 --> 01:46:22,537
Let them attack. Let them
tore each other apart.

854
01:46:22,820 --> 01:46:27,430
And then, we will take action.

855
01:46:27,430 --> 01:46:32,580
You can act as you want.
I will attack Togay.

856
01:46:32,895 --> 01:46:37,995
-I will never allow such an attack.
-Osman Bey! Father!

857
01:46:38,696 --> 01:46:42,696
Your goal is the same.

858
01:46:42,696 --> 01:46:46,696
But you have different methods.

859
01:46:48,328 --> 01:46:52,668
Don't say things that are impossible
to take back.

860
01:46:53,677 --> 01:46:57,677
I have spoken.

861
01:46:57,677 --> 01:47:01,677
I don't ask for permission to attack
my archenemy.

862
01:47:07,481 --> 01:47:11,481
Umur Bey...

863
01:47:17,752 --> 01:47:24,152
If you act your own and
fail my plan...

864
01:47:24,556 --> 01:47:30,106
then, I'm not responsible
of what happens.

865
01:47:30,106 --> 01:47:33,376
Know that.

866
01:47:54,958 --> 01:48:00,728
Do you see?
How he threatens us...

867
01:48:00,728 --> 01:48:05,008
My bey, don't!
We need unity.

868
01:48:05,008 --> 01:48:09,468
You should've told that to
Osman Bey, not me.

869
01:48:09,468 --> 01:48:13,468
I will, then!

870
01:48:39,857 --> 01:48:43,857
Osman Bey!

871
01:48:44,221 --> 01:48:47,671
Wait!

872
01:48:52,534 --> 01:48:55,844
I have things to say.

873
01:49:03,468 --> 01:49:09,358
Osman Bey, Umur Bey's intentions are
good. Be understanding.

874
01:49:09,456 --> 01:49:14,606
It isn't as hard as it seems to
find a middle ground.

875
01:49:19,521 --> 01:49:25,281
Malhun Hatun, I understand
your efforts, I admire it.

876
01:49:25,281 --> 01:49:29,918
But I have spoken.

877
01:49:29,918 --> 01:49:34,228
It is Umur Bey who
disrespects my word.

878
01:49:36,529 --> 01:49:41,139
Now, it's his responsibility.

879
01:49:46,149 --> 01:49:51,379
Alps! Come on!

880
01:49:53,529 --> 01:49:56,389
Göktuğ!

881
01:49:56,389 --> 01:50:01,009
Keep your eyes on Umur Bey's tribe.
I want to know all his moves.

882
01:50:01,009 --> 01:50:05,149
As you order, my bey.

883
01:50:20,782 --> 01:50:29,292
-Allah is ever living!
-Allah is true!

884
01:50:29,292 --> 01:50:34,452
Kumral Abdal! If you hold it like
that, you can't use all your power!

885
01:50:39,157 --> 01:50:44,027
Come on, Kumral Abdal!
We have many swords to make!

886
01:50:51,501 --> 01:50:56,111
Who taught this woman to use
it like this.

887
01:51:03,618 --> 01:51:07,618
-Salam Alaikum.
-Alaikum Salam.

888
01:51:12,100 --> 01:51:15,770
-Where did that come from?
-Good day.

889
01:51:15,770 --> 01:51:18,930
Thank you.

890
01:51:19,740 --> 01:51:24,970
-It's about a good event.
-Who is getting married?

891
01:51:25,219 --> 01:51:29,989
A young man who became a Muslim
is handing out food.

892
01:51:30,898 --> 01:51:34,898
Who is that young man?

893
01:51:34,898 --> 01:51:38,898
He spent the last night at
Sheik Edebali's lodge.

894
01:51:38,898 --> 01:51:41,418
He is handing food out today.

895
01:51:45,794 --> 01:51:49,794
Who do you think he is?

896
01:51:51,896 --> 01:51:57,566
Cerkutay.
He has no money.

897
01:51:57,566 --> 01:52:02,366
-How did he afford it?
-He sold his armor.

898
01:52:49,286 --> 01:52:53,286
-You sold your armor, huh?
-Yeah.

899
01:52:56,392 --> 01:53:00,392
Now it's on us.

900
01:53:00,392 --> 01:53:04,392
The women of the Kayı will prepare you
alp clothes and armor.

901
01:53:04,605 --> 01:53:10,185
-It will be ready before Osman Bey comes.
-Alp clothes?

902
01:53:10,857 --> 01:53:14,857
And Master Davud will afford it.

903
01:53:23,526 --> 01:53:28,856
Kumral Abdal said that he is hopeful
about that mad lad.

904
01:53:28,856 --> 01:53:34,546
Don't underestimate Kumral Abdal's
wisedom, Osman Bey.

905
01:53:34,546 --> 01:53:38,546
Not at all, my sheik.
Not at all!

906
01:53:38,546 --> 01:53:43,156
Kumral Abdal enlightened the night
that was in Cerkutay's heart like a crescent.

907
01:53:45,017 --> 01:53:50,307
That crescent turned into a half moon
with Bamsı Bey.

908
01:53:50,307 --> 01:53:55,147
And it turned into a full moon with
your light.

909
01:53:55,147 --> 01:53:59,147
Not at all.
Not at all.

910
01:53:59,877 --> 01:54:06,917
He told me that the first light was the
moment he saw you performing salaat.

911
01:54:13,116 --> 01:54:19,196
I will perform ablution with the water
and perform salaat.

912
01:54:19,396 --> 01:54:24,746
-Then, we'll be on our way.
-Is it time? Our enemies are waiting.

913
01:54:24,746 --> 01:54:29,156
Nothing can stop us from
praying to our Allah.

914
01:54:46,614 --> 01:54:51,854
Look at him. We can cut his throat
if we want it.

915
01:54:51,854 --> 01:54:55,854
He isn't afraid.

916
01:54:57,458 --> 01:55:02,938
Dying for their faith is most
wanted by the Muslims.

917
01:55:06,479 --> 01:55:10,479
He has faith as strong
as a rock.

918
01:55:10,479 --> 01:55:15,109
If we had his faith, we would make
the world our slave.

919
01:55:30,383 --> 01:55:35,153
Is that so, my sheik?
Is that so?

920
01:55:35,651 --> 01:55:38,351
Mashallah.

921
01:55:39,831 --> 01:55:43,571
Mashallah.

922
01:55:50,971 --> 01:55:53,811
My sheik.

923
01:55:55,756 --> 01:56:01,386
The sultan wants us to act as vassals
to the Mongol.

924
01:56:02,575 --> 01:56:08,525
But Umur Bey seems like he will
ruin my plans.

925
01:56:12,889 --> 01:56:20,169
This cause sees no relations.
If he attacks Togay...

926
01:56:20,169 --> 01:56:25,279
if he destroys the plan I've
made with the sultan...

927
01:56:29,734 --> 01:56:34,394
then my answer will be harsh.

928
01:56:36,636 --> 01:56:40,636
If this disagreement turns
into animosity...

929
01:56:40,636 --> 01:56:45,116
it won't be good for the Turkmens,
Osman Bey.

930
01:56:45,686 --> 01:56:50,696
It won't, my sheik.
It won't. But it seems that way.

931
01:56:50,916 --> 01:56:54,916
Inshallah, Allah will unite
the paths of...

932
01:56:54,916 --> 01:56:58,916
those who seek the
same destination.

933
01:57:00,463 --> 01:57:05,243
Inshallah, my sheik.
Inshallah.

934
01:57:05,950 --> 01:57:11,680
You can leave, Osman Bey.

935
01:57:13,921 --> 01:57:17,251
Thank you.

936
01:57:27,520 --> 01:57:32,250
Now it's on us, dear friends.

937
01:57:32,531 --> 01:57:37,371
We have to put these two beys
on the same path again.

938
01:57:37,766 --> 01:57:42,016
Or the future of the Turkmens
is doomed.

939
01:57:46,683 --> 01:57:50,683
May I enter, my bey?

940
01:57:50,683 --> 01:57:54,113
Come, Cerkutay!

941
01:58:19,235 --> 01:58:22,875
Come closer.

942
01:59:06,112 --> 01:59:12,112
May Allah bless it. May you become
a renowned ghazi...

943
01:59:12,112 --> 01:59:16,462
who serves to the Kayı,
to Islam.

944
01:59:38,387 --> 01:59:43,777
The salaat. The salaat is the
foundation of the religion.

945
01:59:44,215 --> 01:59:49,665
It's how the subject reaches
to Allah.

946
01:59:49,689 --> 01:59:54,319
For this reason, you can remember that
you are a subject, five times a day.

947
01:59:54,702 --> 01:59:59,032
You can remember who is giving
the food you eat.

948
01:59:59,246 --> 02:00:01,726
Here.

949
02:00:07,974 --> 02:00:15,214
I've become a Muslim. I'll do
everything I need to, my bey.

950
02:00:18,434 --> 02:00:24,214
If my Allah forgives even
a man like me...

951
02:00:25,047 --> 02:00:29,047
I will do everything he wants
me to do.

952
02:00:30,497 --> 02:00:33,897
Mashallah.

953
02:00:34,506 --> 02:00:37,276
Mashallah.

954
02:00:51,663 --> 02:00:54,383
This is our book.

955
02:00:55,143 --> 02:01:00,513
Our path, our light,
the crown of our heads.

956
02:01:10,154 --> 02:01:14,374
We are responsible for every
verse it has.

957
02:01:14,515 --> 02:01:19,325
And we'll serve it until the
end of times.

958
02:01:39,091 --> 02:01:42,581
Mashallah.

959
02:01:48,776 --> 02:01:53,016
-May I enter, my bey?
-Come in, Göktuğ.

960
02:02:02,038 --> 02:02:06,038
My bey, Umur Bey and his
alps are preparing.

961
02:02:06,038 --> 02:02:09,358
It seems that they'll move
on the dawn.

962
02:02:20,480 --> 02:02:24,480
He will attack, huh?

963
02:02:24,480 --> 02:02:28,480
-Prepare all the alps, brother.
-Is your decision final, Osman Bey?

964
02:02:28,480 --> 02:02:32,480
-My decision is final, Bamsı Bey.
-If Umur Bey doesn't step back...

965
02:02:32,480 --> 02:02:36,480
will you spill Turkmen blood?

966
02:04:05,674 --> 02:04:11,714
-Umur Bey left the tribe with his alps.
-Good.

967
02:04:11,714 --> 02:04:16,124
Let's greet Togay nicely.

968
02:05:09,411 --> 02:05:12,541
Umur Bey!

969
02:05:12,997 --> 02:05:16,997
My decision is final!

970
02:05:18,180 --> 02:05:24,100
I won't let you destroy the future
of the Muslims for your personal grudge!

971
02:05:24,624 --> 02:05:28,624
Return at once!

972
02:05:30,647 --> 02:05:36,477
This is the end of words, Osman Bey!
Get away from the jihadists!

973
02:05:40,732 --> 02:05:45,262
Osman Bey! My bey!
What are you doing?

974
02:05:45,262 --> 02:05:50,492
Malhun! Get back.
I won't say it again.

975
02:05:50,937 --> 02:05:57,107
I'm saying it for the last time, Osman
Bey. Open the way for the jihadists.

976
02:05:57,365 --> 02:05:59,935
Umur Bey!

977
02:06:03,491 --> 02:06:07,491
Don't force me to do things that
I don't want to!

978
02:06:13,164 --> 02:06:16,834
Stop!

979
02:06:18,433 --> 02:06:21,793
Stop!

980
02:06:34,152 --> 02:06:38,832
-My sheik.
-Osman Bey, stop.

981
02:06:49,598 --> 02:06:55,438
If you want it, I'll do anything.

982
02:07:10,122 --> 02:07:15,222
Umur Bey, what are you doing?

983
02:07:18,315 --> 02:07:22,315
Return at once.

984
02:07:34,915 --> 02:07:39,965
My sheik, I trust your justice.

985
02:07:39,965 --> 02:07:44,545
But you say stop to Osman Bey...

986
02:07:44,545 --> 02:07:48,795
and you say return to us.

987
02:07:49,660 --> 02:07:55,150
If we were content with returning,
this wouldn't happen.

988
02:07:55,150 --> 02:08:00,350
You disrespected Osman Bey's words.

989
02:08:08,143 --> 02:08:13,643
-Will you respect mine too?
-Aren't we supposed to jihad, my sheik?

990
02:08:15,114 --> 02:08:18,254
We are.

991
02:08:18,254 --> 02:08:23,114
But starting disunion is haram.

992
02:08:34,184 --> 02:08:39,474
It will happen as my sheik says.

993
02:08:48,465 --> 02:08:54,035
We came here for jihad.
Allah knows that...

994
02:08:54,035 --> 02:08:59,425
no one else but Edebali could
convince me to return.

995
02:09:06,974 --> 02:09:11,564
Come on.
We are returning to the tribe.

996
02:09:35,524 --> 02:09:40,484
Osman Bey. I have things to
tell you.

997
02:09:40,484 --> 02:09:44,484
Go on, my sheik.

998
02:09:49,658 --> 02:09:57,578
This animosity must end for
the sake of the Turkmens.

999
02:09:58,486 --> 02:10:02,486
You are right, my sheik.

1000
02:10:02,486 --> 02:10:06,486
There is only one way.

1001
02:10:06,486 --> 02:10:11,406
You will do as Ertuğrul Ghazi said.

1002
02:10:14,921 --> 02:10:20,901
You will marry with Umur Bey's
daughter...

1003
02:10:22,046 --> 02:10:26,046
Malhun Hatun.